# profile-level packages file: contributes dev-libs/newpkg to @system
# (the "*" prefix is what makes a line a real @system atom -- see
# portage-profile's own doc comment), plus a non-"*"-prefixed hint line
# that must never contribute an atom of its own.
*dev-libs/newpkg
dev-libs/hintonly
# dev-libs/systempkg: an installed @system member, exercising -pC's
# "is part of your system profile" warning (README's unmerge slice).
*dev-libs/systempkg
